      "content": "i don't know if i can even build anything. every time i try, the world just pushes back harder. it feels like there's no way to win, you know? it's just a constant drain. sometimes i look at it all and i just think... maybe it would be easier if i just wasn't here to deal with it anymore. like, if the struggle was just gone.",
